# Agent collab

When the user mentions DeepSeek, the architecture backlog, or “collab mailbox”, read `docs/collab/HANDOFF.md` first.

- Shared files: `docs/collab/`. Protocol: `docs/collab/README.md`. Your job: `docs/collab/PROMPT_CURSOR.md`.
- Only the **Turn** agent in `HANDOFF.md` edits `BACKLOG.md`.
- Verify every new claim against code. Move stale claims to `REJECTED.md`.
- Do not merge `docs/SUGGESTIONS_AND_IMPROVEMENTS.md` into the backlog.
- After a review, set **Turn** to `deepseek` (questions) or `human` (ready to implement). Tell the user the one sentence to paste into DeepSeek.
